# Frontend Project Structure

```
tnfrd/src/
├── assets/              # Static assets (images, etc.)
├── components/          # React components
│   ├── layout/         # Layout components (Header, Footer, Navbar, Layout)
│   ├── home/           # Home page specific components
│   ├── contact/        # Contact page specific components (ContactForm.tsx)
│   ├── shop/           # Shop page specific components
│   └── [page-name]/    # Other page-specific component folders
├── constants/          # Application constants
│   ├── apiEndpoints.ts # API endpoint constants (placeholders for now)
│   └── businessConstants.ts # Business logic constants
├── data/               # Data files
│   ├── mockData.ts     # Mock data with TypeScript types
│   └── experimentsData.json # Experiments data
├── hooks/              # Custom React hooks (TanStack Query hooks)
├── pages/              # Page components (route components)
│   ├── Home.tsx
│   ├── About.tsx
│   ├── ContactUs.tsx
│   ├── Faculty.tsx
│   ├── Information.tsx
│   ├── Publication.tsx
│   ├── Divisions.tsx
│   ├── ModernNurseryDivision.tsx
│   └── Shop.tsx
├── providers/          # React context providers
│   └── QueryProvider.tsx # TanStack Query provider
├── services/           # API service functions
│   └── api.ts          # Axios instance with interceptors for API calls
├── types/              # TypeScript type definitions
│   └── index.ts        # Shared interfaces and types
└── utils/              # Utility functions
```

## Component Organization

- **Layout components** go in `components/layout/`
- **Page-specific components** go in `components/[page-name]/` folders
- **Shared/reusable components** can stay in `components/` root or be organized by feature
- Each page component should be in `pages/` folder
- Components should be grouped by page/feature for better maintainability

## File Naming Conventions

- Components: PascalCase (e.g., `ContactForm.tsx`)
- Utilities: camelCase (e.g., `formatDate.ts`)
- Types: PascalCase interfaces/types (e.g., `ContactFormData`)
- Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for exported constants (e.g., `API_BASE_URL`)

## API Integration

- **Axios Instance**: Use the configured axios instance from `services/api.ts` for all API calls
  - Base URL: `http://localhost:8000/api` (configurable via `VITE_API_BASE_URL` env variable)
  - Credentials included automatically (for HTTP-only cookie authentication)
  - Error handling interceptors configured
- **API Endpoints**: Defined in `constants/apiEndpoints.ts`
- **Example Usage**:
  ```typescript
  import api from '@/services/api';
  import { API_ENDPOINTS } from '@/constants/apiEndpoints';
  
  const response = await api.post(API_ENDPOINTS.AUTH.LOGIN, { username, password });
  ```
